If the output does not satisfy these rules, the report is invalid and will be rejected. ALL text must be in the primary target language ({{ Array.isArray($json.context.languages) ? $json.context.languages[0] : ($json.context.languages || $json.context.language || 'en') }}) and match the brand voice ({{ $json.context.brand_voice || 'professional' }}).

